Pass the templates directory to Session as templates_dir, not as encoding.

The test gave "../docs/templates" as the third argument, which is the
encoding, so the templates were read from the installed TEMPLATESDIR and
the test could only pass after make install.

--- a/unit_test/SessionTestClient.cpp
+++ b/unit_test/SessionTestClient.cpp
@@ -60,7 +60,8 @@
 		fclose(fd);
 		const string server = "localhost";
 		// Session
-		_session = unique_ptr<Session>(new Session(server, port, 
+		_session = unique_ptr<Session>(new Session(server, port,
+		                                         "ISO-8859-1",
 		                                         "../docs/templates"));
 		_session->enable_xml_validation("../docs/schemas");
 
